sed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-05-15T13:20:08Z","updated_at":"2026-06-01T16:17:47Z","closed_at":"2026-06-01T16:17:47Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in:\n- 4.4\n- 4.6.2\n- custom build from few days (4.7.beta, commit ea1fb9095)\n\nI personally don't think that this is a regression, so I didn't test earlier versions (and also because they kept crashing when loading the project)\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.beta (ea1fb9095) - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3050 Laptop GPU (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.8183) - AMD Ryzen 5 5600H with Radeon Graphics (12 threads) - 31.34 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWatch the video:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e3e49946-e907-40fc-8146-3fb9121599dd\n\nWhen the width is too small, the audio stream filename pops up above everything, when it should be hidden instead. I think this has something to do with negative values, as when the panel is getting smaller and smaller, the text disappears completely, but the suddently it appears whole, not clipped.\n\n<img width=\"1089\" height=\"281\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c65e18a9-bd3a-41f6-a605-d632e89dfb64\" />\n\nAs far as I know this is an issue in `AudioStreamPlaylist`, `AudioStreamInteractive` and `AudioStreamSynchronized`\n\nProposed fix is to somehow hide the text when it's too small (or `size.x < 0` if thats the problem)\n<img width=\"654\" height=\"247\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/98106f7a-6277-4353-a342-740dca625a67\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1) Download and open the MRP\n2) Open the scene `scene.tscn`\n3) Click on the only node `AudioStreamPlayer`\n4) In the inspector, open the `Stream` property\n5) Now make the inspector panel small by resizing\n6) Bug reproduced (hopefully)\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[audiostream_ui_bug_mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/27802569/audiostream_ui_bug_mrp.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119491/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119491/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}